OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects are British men
OL,4,Ain their 20s, police say, as Iranian
OL,5,Aembassy denies involvement
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,9,FSunday morning are UK nationals in
OL,10,Ftheir 20s who live in London, police
OL,11,Fsay
OL,13,FThey were arrested under the Explosives
OL,14,FAct and on suspicion of preparing a
OL,15,Fterrorist act - BBC Verify has looked
OL,16,Fat the "company" vans seen nearby
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
