OL,3,ABest thing we can offer young people is
OL,4,Aa job, not benefits, says chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor has warned against
OL,7,Fallowing Britain's benefits bill to
OL,8,Fballoon while not offering young people
OL,9,Fopportunities.
OL,11,FJohn Healey told Labour's annual
OL,12,Fconference in Liverpool that cutting
OL,13,Fwelfare spending was "more than an
OL,14,Feconomic must - it's a moral duty".
OL,16,F"The best thing we can offer a young
OL,17,Fperson is not a benefit payment - it's
OL,18,Fa first job with training and a wage,"
OL,19,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
