OL,3,AUK diesel price hits all-time high, the
OL,4,ARAC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiesel prices have hit an all-time high
OL,7,Fof 199.18p per litre, according to the
OL,8,FRAC motoring organisation, as the war
OL,9,Fin the Middle East continues to push up
OL,10,Fthe cost of fuel.
OL,12,FPetrol prices are also still rising,
OL,13,Fwith a litre currently costing 174.13p.
OL,15,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,16,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,17,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,18,Fwholesale oil across the region,
OL,19,Fcausing the price of fuels made from
OL,20,Foil to surge.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
