OL,3,AMexico's Pacific coast braces for
OL,4,AHurricane Polo
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living on the northern Pacific
OL,7,Fcoast of Mexico are bracing for the
OL,8,Farrival of Hurricane Polo, which is
OL,9,Fforecast to make landfall later on
OL,10,FMonday or early on Tuesday.
OL,12,FThe category three storm, with maximum
OL,13,Fsustained winds near 115 mph (185
OL,14,Fkm/h), is expected to move over the
OL,15,Fstate of Baja California Sur, a region
OL,16,Fpopular with tourists and home to the
OL,17,Fresort destination of Los Cabos.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
