OL,3,AMexico's Pacific coast braces for
OL,4,AHurricane Polo
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeteorologists at the US-based National
OL,7,FHurricane Center (NHC) have warned of
OL,8,Fheavy rainfall which could lead to
OL,9,Flife-threatening flooding and
OL,10,Fmudslides, especially in areas of steep
OL,11,Fterrain.
OL,13,FResidents on Sunday stocked up on
OL,14,Fessentials such as drinking water and
OL,15,Ffood as the storm approached.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
