OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APlan for controversial Sydney data
OL,4,Acentre scrapped after push-back
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company confirmed it was
OL,7,Fwithdrawing its application in a letter
OL,8,Fto the local planning authority. It
OL,9,Ffollows a concerted opposition against
OL,10,Fthe data centre by local residents and
OL,11,Fcampaigners.
OL,13,FThe dispute captures a wider
OL,14,Fdisagreement in Australia over the role
OL,15,Fof data centres.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
